# CI-ION OASIS-E2 SOC simulator narration audio (~950MB of WAVs).
# Built from C:\AI\Git\training\CI-ION\CI-ION_OASIS-E2_SOC (npm run build,
# then copy dist/* into public/advanced-training/oasis-e2-soc/). Re-copy
# the assets when deploying; too large to commit, same as media above.
public/advanced-training/oasis-e2-soc/assets/*.wav

# Real approved-users allowlist (PII) — image build copies it; never commit
config/approved-users.csv

